WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.980
Hi, I'm Zidan, based in Cairo, Egypt,

2
00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:05.080
and I specialize in lead generation,

3
00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:08.240
cold calling, lead management, and appointment setting.

4
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.580
I have over three years of experience

5
00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:13.940
working in U.S. real estate cold calling and lead generation,

6
00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:17.400
along with around one year of direct lead manager experience

7
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.800
working with U.S. clients and investors.

8
00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:22.180
I've also worked in the solar market,

9
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.360
which has helped me adapt to different audiences,

10
00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:26.440
sales approaches, and business goals.

11
00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:29.740
But what I bring to a business goes beyond making calls

12
00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:30.990
or following a script.

13
00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.160
My focus is on turning conversations into qualified opportunities,

14
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:36.840
building trust with prospects,

15
00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:40.280
and helping businesses make better use of the leads they generate.

16
00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:42.150
When it comes to cold calling,

17
00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.900
I understand that every conversation is different.

18
00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:48.080
I know how to build rapport, communicate naturally,

19
00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:51.400
ask the right questions, handle objections professionally,

20
00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:53.080
and keep conversations moving

21
00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:55.200
without making prospects feel pressured.

22
00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:58.920
I focus on understanding the person on the other end of the call,

23
00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:00.470
identifying their needs,

24
00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.000
and recognizing when there's a genuine opportunity worth pursuing.

25
00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:07.320
In real estate, I understand how important it is

26
00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:09.580
to uncover a seller's real motivation.

27
00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:13.440
I can qualify homeowners by asking about their reason for selling,

28
00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:17.620
property condition, occupancy, timeline, and price expectations.

29
00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:21.880
I also understand that some opportunities require consistent follow-up

30
00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:23.440
rather than a single conversation,

31
00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:25.740
so I focus on maintaining communication

32
00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:28.060
and keeping promising leads engaged.

33
00:01:28.780 --> 00:01:31.860
As a lead manager, I look beyond the initial conversation.

34
00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:36.300
I focus on lead qualification, follow-up, pipeline organization,

35
00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:39.940
and making sure important information is documented accurately.

36
00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.760
My goal is to keep opportunities moving,

37
00:01:42.940 --> 00:01:45.160
prevent qualified leads from being overlooked,

38
00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:48.820
and provide the acquisitions team with clear, useful information

39
00:01:48.820 --> 00:01:50.760
so they can decide on the next step.

40
00:01:51.140 --> 00:01:53.540
I also have experience with appointment setting,

41
00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:56.560
coordinating next steps, and supporting the sales process

42
00:01:56.560 --> 00:01:59.740
from initial contact through qualification and handoff.

43
00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:03.180
I understand the importance of respecting a client's process,

44
00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:06.460
following the right criteria, and keeping the team informed.

45
00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:10.040
I'm also comfortable working with the systems behind the process.

46
00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:12.560
I've worked with tools and platforms such as

47
00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:16.560
GoHighLevel, ReadyMode, CallTools, REI Sift,

48
00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:20.960
Mojo Dialer, Enzo, and other CRM and lead management systems.

49
00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:25.360
I understand that these tools are only as useful as the way they're managed.

50
00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:27.980
That's why I pay attention to accurate records,

51
00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:32.200
organized pipelines, consistent follow-ups, and clear next actions.

52
00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:34.920
I can also adapt to new tools and workflows

53
00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.300
when a business has its own systems in place.

54
00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:40.620
Beyond the technical side, I bring strong communication,

55
00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:44.020
consistency, accountability, and a willingness to learn.

56
00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:48.160
I'm comfortable working remotely, following established processes,

57
00:02:48.420 --> 00:02:49.720
managing my responsibilities,

58
00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:52.320
and communicating with clients and team members.

59
00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:56.100
I take feedback seriously, work toward agreed targets,

60
00:02:56.220 --> 00:02:59.260
and focus on improving the quality of my work over time.

61
00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:01.480
I've worked toward performance targets,

62
00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:03.460
been recognized as a top achiever,

63
00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:07.080
and learned how important consistency and attention to detail are

64
00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:08.760
in a results-driven environment.

65
00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:11.180
Whether you need someone to generate leads,

66
00:03:11.320 --> 00:03:15.060
speak with homeowners, qualify opportunities, book appointments,

67
00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:17.580
manage follow-ups, organize your pipeline,

68
00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:19.980
or support your day-to-day sales operations,

69
00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:23.740
I can help connect those moving parts and keep the process organized.

70
00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:26.320
My goal isn't just to complete tasks.

71
00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:29.120
It's to become someone your business can rely on.

72
00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:32.160
Someone who communicates clearly, takes ownership,

73
00:03:32.340 --> 00:03:34.000
protects the quality of your leads,

74
00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:37.520
and helps your team spend more time on the opportunities that matter.

75
00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:39.700
If you're looking for a reliable professional

76
00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:42.600
who understands both the conversations and the process

77
00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:44.860
behind lead generation and lead management,

78
00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:48.240
I'd be glad to learn about your business, understand your goals,

79
00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:50.680
and discuss how I can contribute to your team.

80
00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:53.100
Thank you for taking the time to get to know me.

81
00:03:53.340 --> 00:03:54.841
I look forward to working with you.
